  "titleBengali": "গুরুদেব দয়া করো",
  "content": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">ভব-সাগর-তারণ-কারণ হে,&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">রবি-নন্দন-বন্ধন-খণ্ডন হে,&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">শরণাগত কিঙ্কর ভীত মনে,&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">গুরুদেব দয়া করো দীনজনে।।</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">হৃদিকন্দর-তামস-ভাস্কর হে,&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">তুমি বিষ্ণু প্রজাপতি শঙ্কর হে,&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">পরব্রহ্ম পরাৎপর বেদ ভণে,&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">গুরুদেব দয়া করো দীনজনে।।</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">মন-বারণ-শাসন-অঙ্কুশ হে,&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">নরত্রাণ তরে হরি চাক্ষুষ হে,&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">গুণগান-পরায়ণ দেবগণে,&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">গুরুদেব দয়া করো দীনজনে।।</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">কুলকুণ্ডলিনী-ঘুম-ভঞ্জক হে,&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">হৃদি-গ্রন্থি-বিদারণ-কারক হে,&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">মম মানস চঞ্চল রাত্রদিনে,&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">গুরুদেব দয়া করো দীনজনে।।</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 2